# Backend Rules

Technology

- Python 3.13
- FastAPI
- SQLAlchemy 2.x
- Pydantic v2

## Style

Use:

- Type hints everywhere
- Dataclasses when appropriate
- Dependency Injection
- Async APIs where beneficial

Functions should have a single responsibility.

Prefer small focused classes.

Avoid utility classes containing unrelated methods.

## Logging

Use structured logging.

Never use print().

## Exceptions

Raise domain-specific exceptions.

Do not swallow exceptions.

Avoid generic Exception.

## Configuration

Never hardcode:

- URLs
- Secrets
- Tokens
- Credentials

Everything comes from configuration.